;----------------------------
;When you start up a dream
;----------------------------
;maybe like you are bound to a chair or something with a full bladder and pleads with the captor to let you go with a percent chance of success or struggle against the ropes i don’t know how that’d work exactly actually

@LUCID_DREAM_START_24
CALL PRINT_GP("W", @"당신은 의자에 앉아 깨어난다. 당신 앞에 %CALLNAME:109%가 위협적으로 서 있다.")
