@LUCID_DREAM_END_24
PRINTFORMW 「그것은 단지 %조사처리(CALLNAME:MASTER,"의")% 악몽이었을까? 아니면 다른 무언가였을까...」
;When a command ends

@LUCID_DREAM_TURN_24
#DIM LevelBefore
#DIM CONST EV24_ChallengeCount = 8
#DIM EV24_ChallengeRoll
